# Resonating Lute's land mana is "Spend this mana only to cast instant and sorcery spells" (CR 106.6): the Island's restricted
# {R}{R} pays neither for a creature spell nor for an activated ability. A second Mox Ruby's unrestricted {R} casts Blazing
# Rootwalla (the control that the creature is castable at all); then, with only the restricted {R}{R} left in the pool and every
# permanent tapped, the Rootwalla's "{R}: +2/+0" can't be activated.

